Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 11:50:58 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 27/28] feat(scripting): engine.registerAudioBuffers

The engine defined the AUDIO_RESOLUTION constants but not the function
scripts pass them to, so every script that reads the audio spectrum
threw at its first line and never ran: 168 scripts across 15 wallpapers
in the test corpus. registerAudioBuffers (16, 32 or 64) now returns
left, right and average arrays that the engine refills from the audio
capture before every update (); the capture is mono, so the three
match, as they do for the shaders.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Tp4kQtVREMqxYupDoiqth6
